cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the mathematical sources described in README.md."
type: software
title: "LPP formalizations in Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: Janjigian
    given-names: Christopher
  - family-names: Rassoul-Agha
    given-names: Firas
  - family-names: Seppäläinen
    given-names: Timo
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A collection of Lean formalizations in last-passage percolation and related
  probability, organized by source paper. Current results include limit-shape
  theorems, differentiability, the BK inequality and Liggett's subadditive
  ergodic theorem.
